# A backstop, because the list above is exact filenames and that failed once:
# arisehub-agent-key.txt was created beside town.mjs before it was listed here,
# and ctrl-alt-agent-api-key.json arrived under a name no rule matched either.
# Any future credential dropped here is covered by its shape now, whether or not
# anyone remembers to add its name.
*-key.txt
*-token.txt
*-key.json
*.key
town-state.json
town-state.json.tmp
# self-update leftovers: the previous engine, the file being checked, the
# boot-guard marker, and an engine that failed to start here
*.bak
*.next.mjs
*.updated
*.rejected
.env
node_modules/
# the villagers' own workshops and projects live on the PC, not in this repo
workshops/
projects/
data/
